// Hand-curated starting skills (position_rules_set_skills) for the three older
// rules sets no importer can supply (CRP, CRP+, BB2016).
//
// Placed in after-other-importers next to position-characteristics.json5 for
// consistency and the same safety margin, though the ordering matters less
// here than it does there: position_rules_set_skills entries are additive per
// (position, rules set) rather than a single overwritable value, and BBL/TP
// only ever write to the newer rules sets.
//
// Every entry's (position, rules set) pair MUST already be curated in
// after-other-importers/position-characteristics.json5: a starting skill hangs
// off the position_rules_sets row, and the API rejects an entry whose pair has
// none. Every skill MUST have a category row for that rules set in
// before-other-importers/skills.json5, for the same reason. Both are asserted
// by curated-data-skills.spec.ts.
//
// A position whose "Skills" cell reads "None" in the source table simply gets
// no entry here.
//
// Every `position` id is the "Name" external id NameExternalIdService.forPosition
// builds -- "<raceName>: <positionName>" -- copied verbatim from
// position-characteristics.json5, not from the rulebook's own spelling.
//
// Source, this file's current scope (the 21 CRP main-book races):
//   CRP -- m750496a_BB_Competition_Rules_Pack.pdf, roster pages 23-25
//          (PDF page numbers; printed page numbers 71-76), "Skills" column.
{
  externalSystems: [
    { name: 'Name', category: 'bookkeeping' },
  ],
  positionRulesSetSkills: [
    // --- CRP: Dark Elf (CRP p.23) ---
